00:29:18.160 --> 00:29:20.160
One of the biggest things
that was taught to me,

00:29:20.160 --> 00:29:22.360
and I'm going to ask you
for the answer for it,

00:29:22.360 --> 00:29:28.080
is if you have data that's
in four different places,

00:29:28.080 --> 00:29:29.040
you have events.

00:29:29.040 --> 00:29:32.280
You have orders, you have
pickups, or drop offs.

00:29:32.280 --> 00:29:34.290
That's what we call a
normalized data structure.

00:29:34.290 --> 00:29:35.910
Raise your hand if you've
