that's precisely right.

00:39:57.430 --> 00:39:58.680
So you can do cool
things with arrays.

00:39:58.680 --> 00:40:00.900
You can just look at one
value, zoom in on just

00:40:00.900 --> 00:40:02.455
one particular value.

00:40:02.455 --> 00:40:03.330
But if I want to do--

00:40:03.330 --> 00:40:07.290
I want to see, hey, how many
things are in that array?

00:40:07.290 --> 00:40:08.440
I can do array length.

00:40:08.440 --> 00:40:09.480
There's a ton of
array of functions.

00:40:09.480 --> 00:40:12.105
I'm just showing you the tip of
the iceberg of some of the most

00:40:12.105 --> 00:40:13.720
common aggregations.

00:40:13.720 --> 00:40:17.190
You have for items in your cart.

00:40:17.190 --> 00:40:19.668
Now here's the issue.

00:40:19.668 --> 00:40:21.960
We saw different levels of
granularity in the bookings.

